message: >-
  If you use the BIOSCAN Browser in your work, please cite the BIOSCAN-5M
  paper below. To credit the browser itself, cite this repository.
title: 'BIOSCAN Browser: a web interface to navigate the BIOSCAN-5M dataset'
type: software
license: MIT
url: https://browser.bioscan-ml.org
repository-code: https://github.com/bioscan-ml/bioscan-browser
date-released: '2024-07-01'
abstract: >-
  A web interface to explore and navigate the BIOSCAN-5M dataset, a
  large-scale multimodal insect biodiversity dataset of specimen images,
  DNA barcodes, and taxonomic labels.
